WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose a woven fabric on the blank cushion.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Draw the embroidery on the felt.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Rotate the finished cushion to inspect the edge.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Five Textile Studio props furnish the repair desk.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
The stitched handbook teaches the ladder stitch.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Alice’s torn cheek closes one stitch at a time.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Pull gently, settle the tension, then release.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Panda’s knit ear needs a hook to recover dropped loops.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Alice sits up. Her old blue ribbon stays.

